		<span id="title-186549813" class="story-title"> <a onclick="return toggle_fh_body_wrap_return(this);" href="//tech.slashdot.org/story/26/11/01/229250/systemds-creator-opens-signups-for-private-preview-of-amutables-cryptographically-verified-linux-systems">SystemD's Creator Opens Signups for Private Preview of Amutable's Cryptographically Verified Linux Systems</a> <span class=" no extlnk"><a class="story-sourcelnk" href="https://itsfoss.com/news/amutable-foundations-private-preview/" title="External link - https://itsfoss.com/news/amutable-foundations-private-preview/" target="_blank"> (itsfoss.com) </a></span></span>

		
		
