	<h2 class="story">
		

		

		
		

		

		

		

		<span id="title-186523620" class="story-title"> <a onclick="return toggle_fh_body_wrap_return(this);" href="//tech.slashdot.org/story/26/10/31/0615204/which-tech-companies-started-using-trumps-phrase-super-intelligence">Which Tech Companies Started Using Trump's Phrase 'Super Intelligence'?</a> <span class=" no extlnk"><a class="story-sourcelnk" href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/30/trump-tech-allies-swap-ai-for-super-intelligence-in-earnings-calls.html" title="External link - https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/30/trump-tech-allies-swap-ai-for-super-intelligence-in-earnings-calls.html" target="_blank"> (cnbc.com) </a></span></span>

		
		
